<title>USA: American List sees record fiscal 1997.</title>
<headline>American List sees record fiscal 1997.</headline>
<dateline>MINEOLA, N.Y. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>American List Corp said on Wednesday its quarterly revenue and earnings growth trend would contribute to boosting results in fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>President Martin Lerner said in a statement he was confident that the growth trend in revenues and earnings experienced in this quarter would contribute to another record year for fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>The company said its second quarter 1996 revenues increased 20 percent to $3.74 million and net earnings increased 30 percent to $0.26 per share.</p>
</text>
